ables AAA functionality (Authentication, Authorization, and Accounting).\\n- In Juniper, we explicitly enable RADIUS services and set it as the authentication/accounting method.\\n- This is the foundational configuration needed before setting up specific RADIUS servers or authentication methods.\", 'trans_template': 'set system authentication-order radius'}]]": 1,
